        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 25 at 5:55PM MDT until September 25 at 6:00PM MDT by NWS Denver CO</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 6 PM MDT this evening for a portion
of northeast Colorado, including the following area, Jefferson.

Flood waters have receded. The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no
longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed any
remaining closures.
